Inspect toolbox versions.

Use this group to list published versions for a toolbox and inspect their
metadata (for example, when deciding which version to retarget as default).

Usage
  azd ai toolbox versions [command]

Available Commands
  list : List published versions for a toolbox.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for versions
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (default "default")
      --project-endpoint string : Foundry project endpoint URL for remote operations only (not local add or extension version).

Examples
  Find available versions before promoting a default
    azd ai toolbox versions list research

Use azd ai toolbox versions [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
